#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:46
#: 179c4bbbc75b4a9d90a49fa3b0a978a8
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:48
#: 070689a2894c4b9b8272eac90bb45579
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the R6/TX6 (UART6_RX/UART6_TX) pins. It supports "
"all serial RC protocols. For protocols requiring half-duplex serial to "
"transmit telemetry (such as FPort) you should setup SERIAL6 with half-"
"duplex, pin-swap and inversion enabled."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在 R6/TX6（UART6_RX/UART6_TX）引脚上，支持所有串口 RC 协议。对于需要半双工串口发送数传的协议（如 "
"FPort），应将 SERIAL6 设置为启用半双工、引脚交换和反转。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:53
#: 7581ed3bc3fd42c4a111bc3641182438
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:55
#: a6bbc083005d4a978a6b22bb8a8ca374
msgid "The T-Motor H7 Mini supports OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 driver)."
msgstr "T-Motor H7 Mini 支持使用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）的 OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:58
#: 1c0ce2c691ba4669a903b45200756351
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:60
#: 675ea479bde445f2aeb0436e201056a8
msgid ""
"The T-Motor H7 Mini supports up to 5 PWM outputs. The pads for motor output "
"M1 to M4 on the motor connectors and separate pads, plus M5 for LED strip or"
" another PWM output."
msgstr ""
"T-Motor H7 Mini 支持最多 5 路 PWM 输出。电机连接器上的电机输出焊盘 M1 至 M4 以及独立焊盘，加上 M5 用于 LED "
"灯带或其他 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:64
#: 5f9a4bd3610e40b19925b370f4dcae61
msgid "The PWM is in 2 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 2 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:67
#: 578580c650a2424abb2c9e7657bcc108
msgid "PWM 1-4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1-4 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:68
#: 9f7455a32ae549469a549d49885183f6
msgid "PWM 5 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 5 在第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:70
#: 13cc9490ba0444f1ad6e388afce9f23d
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. Channels 1-4 support bi-directional dshot."
msgstr ""
"同一组内的通道需使用相同的输出频率。如果某组中的任意通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道都需要使用 DShot。通道1-4支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:75
#: ef789b0309f04a58a542b1424bfd91fd
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:77
#: 9c3974c5081b48e9aa68295766e54545
msgid ""
"The board has a builtin voltage and current sensor. The current sensor can "
"read up to 130 Amps. The voltage sensor can handle up to 6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "飞控板内置电压和电流传感器。电流传感器最大可读 130A，电压传感器最大支持 6S 锂电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:81
#: cb87badd92ac49d8bc2a837c6ef62aac
msgid "The correct battery setting parameters are:"
msgstr "正确的电池设置参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:84
#: c6ffabd0f2354b34905f975bc9990f1e
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:85
#: c462b41ee47f4ff28ceec6474d0f26a6
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:86
#: f831151537344e85bd9e7458b0a31e6d
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:87
#: 36cf38d750de4768ad9342f01bdd148f
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.0"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:88
#: 9006b2a6a2f9404f803a2518ae832e05
msgid ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 50.0"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 50.0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:91
#: b817385090eb4b02a6aa58e6f3bd7f01
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:93
#: 4de21da1ac5747a19fd51659cd25e24d
msgid ""
"The T-Motor H7 Mini does not have a builtin compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "T-Motor H7 Mini 没有内置罗盘，但您可以通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘上的 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:96
#: 9a5232304f904ec3b7e151eae66b22a5
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:98
#: 91c75582dfb7404bb493b8b323199dbb
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件加载可通过按住引导程序按钮插入USB以DFU方式完成。然后使用您喜欢的DFU加载工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tmotor-h7-mini.rst:102
#: 27e508f2c98a483abeb331d2157d442a
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the \\*.apj "
"firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可以使用任意 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
